    },
    {
      "id": "te36",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47.19999999999999,
      "y": 923.75,
      "width": 705.6,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 618341637,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1307729535,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The deterrence rule\nA false receipt must not pay. Detection by audit and by challenge together,\nP_d = p + (1 \u2212 p)\u00b7q, must satisfy  P_d \u00b7 (V + \u03bb\u00b7S)  \u2265  max( c_exec + (1 \u2212 \u03b8)\u00b7V , V )\nwhere V is payment, S stake, \u03bb the share of stake that can be taken,\nc_exec the cost of doing the work and \u03b8 the chance honest work passes.\nThe calculator on the research site solves it, including the concurrency bound",
      "originalText": "The deterrence rule\nA false receipt must not pay. Detection by audit and by challenge together,\nP_d = p + (1 \u2212 p)\u00b7q, must satisfy  P_d \u00b7 (V + \u03bb\u00b7S)  \u2265  max( c_exec + (1 \u2212 \u03b8)\u00b7V , V )\nwhere V is payment, S stake, \u03bb the share of stake that can be taken,\nc_exec the cost of doing the work and \u03b8 the chance honest work passes.\nThe calculator on the research site solves it, including the concurrency bound",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rule",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "assume",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 2104909469,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 157197672,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
